    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DashBall \u2013 The Ultimate Speed Showdown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready for ultra-fast duels in DashBall, a competitive game where reflexes and strategy make all the difference! Face off against your opponents in intense matches where every move counts, and use spells to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast-Paced Gameplay: Rapid and dynamic exchanges that test your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spells &amp; Power-ups: Catch temporary spells on the map to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Varied Game Modes: Competitive 1v1, fast-paced matches with special rules, and unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ranking &amp; Competition: Climb the leaderboard, face the best players, and become the master of the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic Maps: Environments that evolve during the match to spice up the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Neon Arcade Style: A retro-futuristic design reminiscent of 80s arcade machines, modernized for a new generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you ready to become the master of DashBall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Add DashBall to your wishlist now and don\u2019t miss the release!<br><br>Note: Once the core game mechanics are developed, I will focus on improving the graphics. The current icons, banners, and visuals are a representation of the intended final look of the game. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DashBall \u2013 The Ultimate Speed Showdown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready for ultra-fast duels in DashBall, a competitive game where reflexes and strategy make all the difference! Face off against your opponents in intense matches where every move counts, and use spells to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast-Paced Gameplay: Rapid and dynamic exchanges that test your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spells &amp; Power-ups: Catch temporary spells on the map to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Varied Game Modes: Competitive 1v1, fast-paced matches with special rules, and unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ranking &amp; Competition: Climb the leaderboard, face the best players, and become the master of the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic Maps: Environments that evolve during the match to spice up the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Neon Arcade Style: A retro-futuristic design reminiscent of 80s arcade machines, modernized for a new generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you ready to become the master of DashBall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Add DashBall to your wishlist now and don\u2019t miss the release!<br><br>Note: Once the core game mechanics are developed, I will focus on improving the graphics. The current icons, banners, and visuals are a representation of the intended final look of the game. </p>",
